{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The House in the Hollow is a first-person adventure game that weaves horror, the occult, and forbidden magic into a mysterious and long forgotten world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Aloysius Abadier, a man driven to uncover the century old mystery surrounding the sudden disappearance of the notorious occultist, Francis Barrett.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey leads you deep into remote, forgotten forests, where a dark and twisted realm awaits steeped in occult rituals, forbidden relics, and shadowed magic. Within the abandoned Manor House, long buried secrets and the power of ancient spells hide dark, malevolent forces that linger in the halls, determined to ensure you never escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blending first-person exploration, puzzle-solving, and discovery, you use the power of forgotten magic to unravel the mystery and awaken the secrets buried within the Hollow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/d7229765abb08aa0e4659c9d58e9c853.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/d7229765abb08aa0e4659c9d58e9c853.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/d7229765abb08aa0e4659c9d58e9c853.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Francis Barrett was an English magician and occultist who led a reclusive life, spending most of his time in an isolated manor house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in a hollow and surrounded by a dense forest, the house was hidden from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little is known about Francis Barrett beyond his authorship of The Magus, a Celestial intelligencer and compendium of occult and magical information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the many years since Francis Barrett disappeared, people have attempted, without success, to find the mysterious house and discover what happened to Mr. Barrett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one can be sure what experiments Francis Barrett performed, or what was conjured up, in that house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some who have gone searching for the house have never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/66c0c1960c88a31cd0c8a422a22dff0d.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/66c0c1960c88a31cd0c8a422a22dff0d.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/66c0c1960c88a31cd0c8a422a22dff0d.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the abandoned halls and shadowed forests of the House in the Hollow, a first-person horror adventure where ancient evil stirs, dark secrets whisper, and long forgotten magic entwines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/8bf4c2b3a80bf550f1f60bd12a494061.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/8bf4c2b3a80bf550f1f60bd12a494061.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/8bf4c2b3a80bf550f1f60bd12a494061.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, progress won't come easy. The game\u2019s handcrafted puzzles blend seamlessly with exploration, rewarding keen observation and curiosity as you decode cryptic symbols, and piece together forbidden rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/97be467aad414a16781a2c68952ccbfe.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/97be467aad414a16781a2c68952ccbfe.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/97be467aad414a16781a2c68952ccbfe.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creaking floorboard, flicker of candlelight, and shadow in the corner of your vision draws you deeper into its lost Art Deco world, frozen in time, with unique locations that will either empower you, or damn you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/60b13b55253b7a8440a0c06d0bc7b2a0.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/60b13b55253b7a8440a0c06d0bc7b2a0.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/60b13b55253b7a8440a0c06d0bc7b2a0.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step forward, the boundary between the living and the dead blurs. Will you master the occult forces working against you, or will you become another lost soul in the Hollow\u2019s grim legacy?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1152710?t=1769349041","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769349041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/f3b75e8148bc0754b1c54eadcc753d6b0489f7e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769349041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/f3b75e8148bc0754b1c54eadcc753d6b0489f7e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769349041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The House in the Hollow is a first-person adventure game that weaves horror, the occult, and forbidden magic into a mysterious and long forgotten world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Aloysius Abadier, a man driven to uncover the century old mystery surrounding the sudden disappearance of the notorious occultist, Francis Barrett.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey leads you deep into remote, forgotten forests, where a dark and twisted realm awaits steeped in occult rituals, forbidden relics, and shadowed magic. Within the abandoned Manor House, long buried secrets and the power of ancient spells hide dark, malevolent forces that linger in the halls, determined to ensure you never escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blending first-person exploration, puzzle-solving, and discovery, you use the power of forgotten magic to unravel the mystery and awaken the secrets buried within the Hollow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/d7229765abb08aa0e4659c9d58e9c853.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/d7229765abb08aa0e4659c9d58e9c853.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/d7229765abb08aa0e4659c9d58e9c853.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Francis Barrett was an English magician and occultist who led a reclusive life, spending most of his time in an isolated manor house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in a hollow and surrounded by a dense forest, the house was hidden from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little is known about Francis Barrett beyond his authorship of The Magus, a Celestial intelligencer and compendium of occult and magical information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the many years since Francis Barrett disappeared, people have attempted, without success, to find the mysterious house and discover what happened to Mr. Barrett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one can be sure what experiments Francis Barrett performed, or what was conjured up, in that house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some who have gone searching for the house have never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/66c0c1960c88a31cd0c8a422a22dff0d.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/66c0c1960c88a31cd0c8a422a22dff0d.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/66c0c1960c88a31cd0c8a422a22dff0d.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the abandoned halls and shadowed forests of the House in the Hollow, a first-person horror adventure where ancient evil stirs, dark secrets whisper, and long forgotten magic entwines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/8bf4c2b3a80bf550f1f60bd12a494061.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/8bf4c2b3a80bf550f1f60bd12a494061.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/8bf4c2b3a80bf550f1f60bd12a494061.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, progress won't come easy. The game\u2019s handcrafted puzzles blend seamlessly with exploration, rewarding keen observation and curiosity as you decode cryptic symbols, and piece together forbidden rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/97be467aad414a16781a2c68952ccbfe.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/97be467aad414a16781a2c68952ccbfe.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/97be467aad414a16781a2c68952ccbfe.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creaking floorboard, flicker of candlelight, and shadow in the corner of your vision draws you deeper into its lost Art Deco world, frozen in time, with unique locations that will either empower you, or damn you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/60b13b55253b7a8440a0c06d0bc7b2a0.poster.avif?t=1769349041\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/60b13b55253b7a8440a0c06d0bc7b2a0.webm?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/extras/60b13b55253b7a8440a0c06d0bc7b2a0.mp4?t=1769349041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step forward, the boundary between the living and the dead blurs. Will you master the occult forces working against you, or will you become another lost soul in the Hollow\u2019s grim legacy?</p>","developers":["PSINE Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1152710/header.jpg?t=1769349041","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The House In The Hollow copyright <strong>PSINE Studios</strong> All  rights reserved. <br>All other trademarks are property of their respective companies.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1152710/1514601779/8879b8f977b5f7a2abce69a5204f0fd27d91bfcd/1769334169/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769336762","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1152710/1514601779/8879b8f977b5f7a2abce69a5204f0fd27d91bfcd/1769334169/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769336762","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1152710/1514601779/8879b8f977b5f7a2abce69a5204f0fd27d91bfcd/1769334169/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=